# Linux artifacts: LF mandatory in the worktree, whatever core.autocrlf is set to.
# Without this, a Windows checkout (autocrlf=true) materializes these files in CRLF, and
# `dotnet publish` copies the worktree bytes verbatim -> the systemd unit / shell scripts
# ship to the customer in CRLF (systemd handles \r poorly: Environment=, ExecStartPre=).
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.service  text eol=lf
